# sfab-ch04 CA secrets: rendered from spec/profile-a.yaml by render/k8s.py; edit the spec and run make render
# <intermediate> <namespace>/<secret>: sfab-ca k8s-secret <intermediate> <namespace>/<secret> on the lab host
# after the namespaces exist; cert-manager's ClusterIssuer lab-ca reads the key pair from it.
platform cert-manager/lab-ca
